text:
{
  "headline": "FDA's records trace our supply to a plant classified VAI 413 days after the shortage posting",
  "headline_cites": ["D3"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "FDA's history shows an earlier shortage for ibutilide fumarate first posted on 2022-04-29 and since resolved, and the drug is not on FDA's current shortage list as of 2026-10-21.",
      "cites": ["D4"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The product label names Pharmacia & Upjohn Company LLC (FEI 1810189) as the registered plant for manufacture, analysis, API manufacture, labeling, and packing.",
      "cites": ["E11"]
    },
    {
      "text": "FDA inspection 1208260 at that plant ended on 2023-06-16 and was classified VAI, with the classification letter dated 2024-09-10 — 413 days after the shortage posting on 2022-04-29.",
      "cites": ["D3", "E10"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The plant has a history of VAI classifications from inspections ending 2009-02-18 through 2023-06-16.",
      "cites": ["E3", "E4", "E5", "E6", "E7", "E8", "E9", "E10"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale General holds 54 vials at 4.5 vials per day for 11.9 days on hand, and Corvale Lakeside holds 12 vials at 1 vial per day for 12.3 days on hand.",
      "cites": ["D1", "D2"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The rule-based best option is to buy from Heritage Pharmaceuticals Inc. d/b/a Avet Pharmaceuticals Inc., which is not on FDA's shortage list today, though its label names no plant we could place.",
      "cites": ["D5"]
    }
  ]
}
